---
permalink: /get-a-quote/
title: "Get Your Export Quote"
description: "Request an FOB or CIF export quote from Green Plus EXIM. Tell us your product, quantity and destination — we respond within 24 business hours."
lang: en
dir: ltr
minimalHeader: true
breadcrumbs: [{ label: "Get a Quote" }]
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<section class="section" style="padding-block-start:var(--sp-4)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2" style="align-items:start;gap:var(--sp-5)">
      <div>
        <h1>Get Your Export Quote</h1>
        <p class="lede">Tell us what you need — product, quantity and destination — and we'll come back with FOB/CIF pricing, lead time and documentation details within 24 business hours.</p>
        <ul style="margin-block-start:var(--sp-3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.7em">
          <li class="cluster"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--color-leaf)"><use href="/assets/icons.svg#icon-check"></use></svg> No obligation</li>
          <li class="cluster"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--color-leaf)"><use href="/assets/icons.svg#icon-check"></use></svg> Samples available on request</li>
          <li class="cluster"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--color-leaf)"><use href="/assets/icons.svg#icon-check"></use></svg> Documentation matched to your destination market</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-block-start:var(--sp-3)">Prefer WhatsApp? <a href="#" data-whatsapp style="text-decoration:underline">Message us directly</a> — {{ site.phoneDisplay }}.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        {% set formId = "landing" %}
        {% include "partials/rfq-form.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
